I think that's possible too. Then the definition of the connector will become something like:

```js
// from
export type AutocompleteConnector = Connector<
  AutocompleteRendererOptions,
  AutocompleteConnectorParams
>;

// to
type AutocompleteXYZ = {
  $$type: 'ais.autocomplete';
  getWidgetRenderState?: (
    renderOptions: InitOptions | RenderOptions
  ) => AutocompleteWidgetRenderState;
};

export type AutocompleteConnector = Connector<
  AutocompleteRendererOptions,
  AutocompleteConnectorParams,
  AutocompleteXYZ,
>;

// with

export type WidgetFactory<TConnectorParams, TWidgetParams, TXyz> = (
  /**
   * The params of the widget.
   */
  widgetParams: TConnectorParams & TWidgetParams
) => Widget & TXyz;
```

